      en: ["PPSP was established as a joint venture between Cambodian and Japanese investors.", "The zone provides employment for over 30,000 local workers.", "Over 50% of the companies operating in PPSP are from Japan.", "PPSP is listed on the Cambodia Securities Exchange (CSX).", "The zone features its own logistics center and dry port facilities.", "PPSP is located approximately 18 kilometers from Phnom Penh city center."],
      es: ["Fundación: 2006", "Superficie: 357 ha", "Fábricas: 200+", "Empleos: 80.000+", "Exención fiscal: 9 años", "Valor de exportación 2022: 2.000 millones USD"],
