      en: ["Joint venture between SCG and Khaou Chuly.", "Operations officially started in 2008.", "Capacity of over 1 million tonnes per year.", "Located in Banteay Meas District, Kampot.", "Major supplier for infrastructure projects nationwide.", "Utilizes extensive local limestone deposits."],
      es: ["Capacidad anual: 1,5 millones de toneladas.", "Puesta en servicio: 2013.", "Utiliza horno seco con precalentador de ciclón.", "Suministro de piedra caliza de cantera propia.", "Certificación ISO 14001.", "Exportación a Vietnam y Tailandia."],
